 with a rope and defeat him!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919070/extras/2d99038236e204a402b5ace5b17e667e.poster.avif?t=1754281211\" width=592 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919070/extras/2d99038236e204a402b5ace5b17e667e.webm?t=1754281211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919070/extras/2d99038236e204a402b5ace5b17e667e.mp4?t=1754281211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
